OL,3,GNEWSAReform councillor confirms
OL,4,Asuspension from party
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Reform UK councillor in Norfolk has
OL,7,Fconfirmed that he has been suspended
OL,8,Ffrom the party.
OL,10,FBut Jack White, who was elected as
OL,11,Fcounty councillor for Watton in May,
OL,12,Fdid not give a reason for his
OL,13,Fsuspension.
OL,15,FNeither Reform, which runs the council,
OL,16,Fnor the authority, offered any comment
OL,17,Fon the 35-year-old's departure.
OL,19,FWhite said he would continue working as
OL,20,Fan independent councillor and he was
OL,21,F"confident the matter will be resolved
OL,22,Fin due course".
